{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1106084-how-would-you-make-genji-as-a-solar","id":1106084,"title":"How would you make Genji as a solar?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-21T09:14:52-07:00","id":1106084,"title":"How would you make Genji as a solar?","content":"So I have fallen into an overwatch trap. Like... I am dreaming in overwatch some night (objectives, respawns, etc.). As such I have been thinking a lot about how to do certain characters as Exalted. Quite a few are easy (e.g. Hanzo), some are difficult (e.g. Sombra), and some almost present too many possibility (e.g. well... you've seen the title). I am a huge fan of these thought experiments, and my hope is that I am not alone.<br /> <br /> So, here are my thoughts. In terms of stats, I would make Genji a dawn with supernal MA (Single Point Shining into the Void and a thrown style if that exists yet). Beyond this, I'd give him a good helping of athletics and stealth. I imagine that his armour would help with movement and reaction (essentially be the source of double jump and deflect). <br /> <br /> Narratively, I imagine a showdown between Genji and his brother in the ruins of a factory cathedral. Genji belonging to the realm had Exalted as a solar, which led his brother to attempt to kill him. Genji is left for dead, but, during the intense fight, a medical automaton is reactivated. The automaton desperately tries to save Genji using whatever means it has available, resulting in him being turned into a cyborg. <br /> <br /> My first thoughts upon having half an hour to kill. I'd like to hear how others would approach the same conversion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1521-jang","name":"Jang","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1521_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-21T13:59:19-07:00","id":1106246,"title":"","content":"When I first read this, I was thinking you were hoping to make the womanizing fop for whom the <i>Genji Monogatari </i>is named into a Solar. I was amused, and mildly impressed, but alas, as that is not the question, I cannot really help you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>All that I write but don't cite is simply my perspective, colored by my experiences and beliefs. I extrapolate a lot, too, so don't take it too seriously. :P","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7858-end","name":"*End","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7858_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-21T14:03:06-07:00","id":1106248,"title":"","content":"Genji might know Single Point Style, but he also demonstrates some impressive things that appear to be just Melee Charms. Like his Deflection Ability.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-21T14:19:38-07:00","id":1106256,"title":"","content":"There's no martial arts style for throwing knives or shuriken, and I have my doubts that Air Dragon Style will stray from using only chakram.<br /> <br /> But Solar Thrown has plenty of Charms that would interest Genji.<br /> <br /> Though I'd sooner try to translate him and his brother as Dragon-Blooded, especially with Third Edition promising to have really awesome Dragon-Blooded.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-21T14:33:51-07:00","id":1106262,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>*End</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1106084-how-would-you-make-genji-as-a-solar?p=1106246#post1106246\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When I first read this, I was thinking you were hoping to make the womanizing fop for whom the <i>Genji Monogatari </i>is named into a Solar. I was amused, and mildly impressed, but alas, as that is not the question, I cannot really help you.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I though the same thing. And he would make a good Eclipse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11395-shaddar","name":"Shaddar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"338"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-21T14:46:58-07:00","id":1106267,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that's what I was thinking, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>All that I write but don't cite is simply my perspective, colored by my experiences and beliefs. I extrapolate a lot, too, so don't take it too seriously. :P","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7858-end","name":"*End","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7858_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-21T15:59:40-07:00","id":1106305,"title":"","content":"Night Caste with supernal Athletics probably. He doesn't do anything super crazy with his shuriken, so a few thrown charms, but not much. As far as his swords, could either go hard Melee focusing on the parry and muderlate branches or split between Single Point and the Parry branch of the melee tree.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-21T19:07:05-07:00","id":1106369,"title":"","content":"Oh that's easy a very seductive an attractive Zenith with some sort of limit break related to how he becomes callous and difficult to please with his various lovers. Basically marrying his manic depressive mode where he would desperately need a woman in order to feel nice for him. And then get to the point where he would never let his lady actually leave their bedroom because he was so mannequin needing to make love all the time. Yeah you can tell that this was basically bedroom book reading from one lady to another. Anyway<br /> oh OverWatch sigh<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1498-darmani","name":"Darmani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1498_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-22T08:23:51-07:00","id":1106566,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1106084-how-would-you-make-genji-as-a-solar?p=1106256#post1106256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's no martial arts style for throwing knives or shuriken, and I have my doubts that Air Dragon Style will stray from using only chakram.<br /> <br /> But Solar Thrown has plenty of Charms that would interest Genji.<br /> <br /> Though I'd sooner try to translate him and his brother as Dragon-Blooded, especially with Third Edition promising to have really awesome Dragon-Blooded.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> On that note, then, how would you translate Genji as a dragon-blooded? It is hard for me to think of an aspect that would fit him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1521-jang","name":"Jang","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1521_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-22T09:58:51-07:00","id":1106625,"title":"","content":"Hasn't anyone considered the option of an <i>Alchemical Exalted</i>? Probably moonsilver caste.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1311230-badassoverlord-s-assorted-homebrew-folder\" target=\"_blank\">Are you in the market for some Martial Arts? Perhaps some custom Artifacts for your campaign?</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10131-badassoverlord","name":"BadassOverlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10131_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-22T12:10:42-07:00","id":1106677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jang</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1106084-how-would-you-make-genji-as-a-solar?p=1106566#post1106566\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On that note, then, how would you translate Genji as a dragon-blooded? It is hard for me to think of an aspect that would fit him.</div> </div> </div> </div>I often have that problem with Dragon-Blooded Aspects.<br /> <br /> I think one just has to accept that Dragon-Blooded functionally get <i>even fewer</i> Aspect and Favored Abilities than it seems, because of how rarely you're going to actually want to invest in <i>half</i> of your Aspect Abilities. With the exception of the Dawn Caste, the Solar Exalted never really had this problem even <i>before</i> they got to choose <i>three other Abilities</i> for potential Caste Abilities.<br /> <br /> <br /> Genji's most important combat Abilities are (in no particular order) Stealth, Athletics, Melee, and Thrown. Anything else is window-dressing. The Fire Aspect works well enough for Genji, and the close-quarters damage of the Fire Anima power fits with his Dragon Blade ultimate.<br /> <br /> Hanzo's personality fits with the Air Aspect, I think. His most important combat Abilities are Awareness and Archery. In the game, he can climb walls like his brother, but he can't double jump. If he skimps out on Athletics Charms, the Air Aspect anima power can make up some of the difference. The Stealth, Lore, Linguistics, and Occult Abilities will properly fit how he took his education more seriously than Genji.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-22T20:48:41-07:00","id":1106857,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BadassOverlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1106084-how-would-you-make-genji-as-a-solar?p=1106625#post1106625\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hasn't anyone considered the option of an <i>Alchemical Exalted</i>? Probably moonsilver caste.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, omnics. <br /> <br /> A pity that alchemicals do not seem to be able to transform. Otherwise, we coudl have bastion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-22T21:28:43-07:00","id":1106870,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1106084-how-would-you-make-genji-as-a-solar?p=1106857#post1106857\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, omnics.<br /> <br /> A pity that alchemicals do not seem to be able to transform. Otherwise, we coudl have bastion.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bastion's turret form is just a very very small Colossus. Or possibly his sentry form.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But sexually.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1797-ellis","name":"Ellis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1797_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-22T23:41:45-07:00","id":1106902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jang</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1106084-how-would-you-make-genji-as-a-solar?p=1106566#post1106566\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> On that note, then, how would you translate Genji as a dragon-blooded? It is hard for me to think of an aspect that would fit him.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say Air.<br /> <br /> Dragon-Blooded fits well narrative given the importance of family and his equally Exalted brother to his narrative.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":